---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import DraftNote from '../components/DraftNote.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy | BayStock Auto Parts" description="How BayStock Auto Parts collects, uses, and protects your information, our use of cookies and analytics, and your California privacy rights." h1="Privacy policy" crumb="Privacy">
  <article class="prose-bay">
    <DraftNote />
    <p>This policy explains what information {SITE.legalName} (“BayStock”, “we”) collects through baystockparts.com, how we use it, and the choices you have. Questions: {SITE.supportEmail}, {SITE.address}.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Order details you give us:</strong> name, optional business name, email, phone number, shipping address, and the parts and quantities you order.</li>
      <li><strong>Messages:</strong> what you send through the contact form, by email, or on WhatsApp.</li>
      <li><strong>Parts assistant:</strong> the questions you type into the chat. They are sent to our AI provider to produce an answer and are not stored by us beyond your browser session.</li>
      <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address, browser type, and pages visited, recorded in server logs for security and rate limiting.</li>
      <li><strong>Information stored in your browser:</strong> your cart (SKUs and quantities), your chosen vehicle, and your cookie choice, kept in your browser’s local storage.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not collect or store payment card details on this website.</p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To process, confirm, ship, and support your order, including sending order emails and contacting you on WhatsApp about payment.</li>
      <li>To answer your questions and handle warranty claims and returns.</li>
      <li>To keep the site secure and prevent abuse.</li>
      <li>With your consent, to measure site use and advertising performance.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>The site works without tracking cookies. If you click “Accept” on the cookie banner, we load Google Analytics, Google Ads conversion tracking, and the Meta Pixel, which set cookies to measure visits and purchases. If you click “Decline”, none of these load. You can change your choice by clearing this site’s data in your browser.</p>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>We share information only with service providers that help us run the business: our hosting and email providers, our shipping carriers and warehouse partner, WhatsApp (when you choose to message us there), our AI provider for the parts assistant, payment processors, and, with your consent, Google and Meta for analytics and advertising. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep order records for as long as needed for accounting, tax, warranty, and legal purposes, and delete or anonymize them afterward.</p>

    <h2>Your California privacy rights</h2>
    <p>If you are a California resident, you have the right to know what personal information we collect and how we use it, to request a copy or deletion of it, to correct it, and to opt out of its sale or sharing for cross-context behavioral advertising. We do not sell personal information. To make a request, email {SITE.supportEmail}. We will verify your request and will not discriminate against you for exercising these rights.</p>

    <h2>Marketing email</h2>
    <p>We send order emails only. We will send marketing email only if you opt in, and every marketing email will include an unsubscribe link.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We will post any changes to this policy on this page with a new effective date.</p>
    <p>Effective date: {'{EFFECTIVE_DATE}'}</p>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
